## Final Computation

The qualifying primes are: **7, 23, 31, 47, 71, 73, 79, 89**.

$$7 + 23 + 31 + 47 + 71 + 73 + 79 + 89 = 420$$

The sum of all such primes $p$ is $\boxed{420}$.

